data: {"id": "13156ae09b8448df-thinking-parallel_evidence-1561", "run_id": "13156ae09b8448df", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "### 1. Kubernetes、Events、YAML 与 kubectl logs 并行采集\n\n并行执行 `kubectl_describe`, `kubectl_events`, `kubectl_get_yaml`, `kubectl_logs`。\n\n- **kubectl_get_yaml**:\n    - `phase`: Pending\n    - `conditions`: Initialized=True, Ready=False, ContainersReady=False, PodScheduled=True\n    - `containerStatuses` (app): `ready=False`, `restarts=0`, `reason=CreateContainerConfigError`\n    - `message`: \"couldn't find key unavailable-key in Secret aiops-case-04/workload-input\"\n    - `nodeName`: node2\n    - `ownerRefe", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 4, "ts_ms": 1789055236310, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

